# Build cache AND the generated offline rustdoc (target/doc). Ignored by git,
# but do NOT `cargo clean` — that deletes the docs you need on a plane.
# See docs/04-offline-workflow.md.
/target

# Vendored dependency source. Was tracked deliberately (565 MB) to guarantee
# offline builds; dropped to save disk. Builds now resolve through crates.io
# and the shared ~/.cargo/registry cache. Ignored so that running
# `cargo vendor` locally does not accidentally re-commit it.
/vendor
